    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like everything i believed in was just a lie. like, i spent my whole life building this version of the world and it just... collapsed. there's no floor anymore. just nothingness. it's weird, i don't even feel sad, i just feel empty. like there's no reason to even bother waking up if nothing actually matters.",
